# Pairs with OwnerMonotonic. The saga may record an abort after its commit,
# so a key that surfaced the batch through its bucket reads the old value.
MODULE: OwnerMonotonicFoldAbortOverturnsCommit
TARGET: OwnerMonotonic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an abort overturns a recorded commit, so a key a reader saw committed goes back
PERTURBS: SagaAbort

--- FIND
SagaAbort ==
    /\ sg = "exec"
--- REPLACE
SagaAbort ==
\* MUTATION: an abort after the decision.
    /\ sg \in {"exec", "decided"}
--- END
